<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00509/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一塑料材质的羽绒服拉链，当在寒冷环境下被舔后会使舔者的舌头粘住，且扯下会导致极度的疼痛（来自鱼骨的描述）。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██大街</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">事发记录节选</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">收起</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p><strong>卡斯特：</strong>你别舔了，小心粘舌头。<br />
<br />
<strong>鱼骨：</strong>怎么可能。这是塑料制的拉链。</p>
<p>（30秒后）</p>
<p><strong>鱼骨：</strong>啊啊啊啊暂丧了！！（此处是鱼骨因舌头被粘住而含糊不清）</p>
<p><strong>卡斯特：</strong>你别硬往下扯啊。</p>
<p><strong>鱼骨：</strong>蔑视，不螣。</p>
<p><strong>鱼骨：</strong>啊<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">-</span>-（尖叫）</p>
</blockquote>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被从羽绒服上拆下并存放于Area-CN-15的低价值异常物品储藏室。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>我跟你们说，这绝对是异常性质<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-465325-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-465325-1')">1</a></sup>的锅。正常情况下我怎么可能会做出如此智障的行为。&#8212;鱼骨</em>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00509" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00509" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00509-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6606914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609921841" alt="kaster-k" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6606914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kaster-k" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6606914); return false;">kaster-k</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1609481451 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">01 Jan 2021 06:10</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="footnotes-footer">
<div class="title">脚注</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-465325-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-465325-1')">1</a>. 目前尚未在项目上发现此异常，研究人员推测这很有可能是鱼骨[数据删除]</div>
</div>
</div>
